ONEDRAFT_QUEUE_URL=redis://redis:6379
Secret values shall not be embedded directly into source code.

12. ENVIRONMENT VARIABLE NAMING
Environment variables shall use a consistent namespace.
Primary prefix:
ONEDRAFT_
Service-specific values may use:
ONEDRAFT_API_
