99. IMPLEMENTATION SUCCESS CRITERIA
The Configuration, Secrets & Environment Management System is successful when OneDraft can:
Start consistently in every supported environment
Validate all required configuration before becoming ready
Separate development, test, staging and production resources
Load secrets without storing them in source control
Prevent secret exposure through logs and APIs
Version significant configuration
